They were feeling guilty because of that gold.

671
00:48:43,459 --> 00:48:45,625
This gold doesn't belong to us, what shall we do with it?

672
00:48:46,605 --> 00:48:47,931
They had a feeling of guilt.

673
00:48:48,651 --> 00:48:53,503
As-Samiri(السَّامِرِيُّ) suggested that, they gather all of this gold together, and they burn it.

674
00:48:54,383 --> 00:48:57,677
And then they made out of it a calf; Ijl(عِجل).

675
00:48:58,023 --> 00:48:59,763
And what did As-Samiri(السَّامِرِيُّ) do?

676
00:49:00,403 --> 00:49:04,516
He threw that dirt that he had with him in the gold.

677
00:49:04,943 --> 00:49:10,601
So it was mixed with the gold, and they molded out of that gold; the shape of Ijl(عِجل); calf.

678
00:49:11,174 --> 00:49:19,846
Somehow, that calf would make a sound, Khuwar(خوار); which is the sound of a cow, as if it was alive.

679
00:49:21,211 --> 00:49:24,367
Some of the commentators of Qur'an says that; what As-Samiri(السَّامِرِيُّ) did?

680
00:49:24,392 --> 00:49:29,124
He made a hole throughout the inside of the animal.

681
00:49:29,179 --> 00:49:34,546
So wind would go in it with make a breezing or whistling sound, so that people would think, it's alive.

682
00:49:34,846 --> 00:49:41,957
Some of them would say; somehow, it was a miracle and because of that dirt in it; it had some sort of life in it.

683
00:49:42,170 --> 00:49:44,446
It wasn't alive, but it was making some sounds.

684
00:49:45,006 --> 00:49:46,513
It was making a sound.

685
00:49:47,213 --> 00:49:53,265
And this was a Fitnah(فِتْنَه) for Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل); when they saw this calf, made out of Gold, making this sound.

686
00:49:53,798 --> 00:49:57,463
As-Samiri(السَّامِرِيُّ) told them; This is your God, so they started worshiping it.

687
00:49:58,503 --> 00:50:01,353
And they were making Sujood(سجود) and Ibadah(عبادة) to the calf.

688
00:50:01,890 --> 00:50:03,378
They were worshiping it.

689
00:50:03,978 --> 00:50:07,105
Musa(موسى) told his people that, I'm gonna be absent for how long?

690
00:50:08,065 --> 00:50:08,772
30 days.

691
00:50:08,878 --> 00:50:10,684
Because the appointments in the beginning was 30.

692
00:50:10,857 --> 00:50:13,684
And then Allahسُبحانه وتعالى told Musa(موسى); add another 10 days.

693
00:50:14,764 --> 00:50:17,243
Bani Israel(بني أسرائيل) did not know that the appointment was changed;

694
00:50:17,383 --> 00:50:20,036
Musa(موسى) did not tell them about the change in time.

695
00:50:20,090 --> 00:50:21,376
So they thought, it was 30 days.

696
00:50:21,510 --> 00:50:26,263
30 days past; 31 days past; 32 days past; where is Musa(موسى)?

697
00:50:26,662 --> 00:50:31,635
They said; Musa(موسى) forgot, where his God is.

698
00:50:32,075 --> 00:50:34,795
He got lost; he did not know that his God is right here.

699
00:50:35,075 --> 00:50:35,728
فَنَسِيَ

700
00:50:35,915 --> 00:50:36,682
He forgot.

701
00:50:37,108 --> 00:50:39,187
They added another evidence.

702
00:50:39,781 --> 00:50:43,607
Number one is that, this calf is making this special sound.

703
00:50:43,954 --> 00:50:49,949
Number Two; Musa(موسى) was said, he's gonna be absent for 30 days and now, he's absent for more than 30 days.

704
00:50:50,203 --> 00:50:50,883
They said;

705
00:50:51,669 --> 00:50:53,849
هَٰذَا إِلَٰهُكُمْ وَإِلَٰهُ مُوسَىٰ فَنَسِيَ۝

706
00:50:53,869 --> 00:50:56,354
This is your god and the god of Musa(موسى); but he forgot.

707
00:50:56,864 --> 00:50:58,324
So this is the story behind the calf.

708
00:50:58,651 --> 00:51:01,080
And we'll get back to that in the end of the story.

709
00:51:02,400 --> 00:51:06,652
صَلَّى الله عَلى سَيَّدِنَا محمد وَعَلى اَلِهِ وَ صَحْبِهِ وَسَلِّمْ

